sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UIController
    participant DownloadAgent
    participant VcsLocalServer
    participant TaskManager

    
    User -->+ UIController: Selects a file to download
    UIController -) DownloadAgent: download(filepath, version)
    DownloadAgent ->>+ VcsLocalServer: /initialize/repository/{repoPath}
    VcsLocalServer ->>- DownloadAgent: 200 OK

    DownloadAgent ->>+ VcsLocalServer: /pickSaveDest
    VcsLocalServer ->>+ OS: Save file dialog
    User -> OS: Pick save destination

    OS ->>- VcsLocalServer: Path selected    
    VcsLocalServer ->>- DownloadAgent: path selected

    DownloadAgent ->>+ VcsLocalServer: Connect download web socket
    VcsLocalServer -) DownloadAgent: Socket opened

    VcsLocalServer ->>- DownloadAgent: socket message {type: "connected"}

    DownloadAgent ->>+ VcsLocalServer: /pull?branch={strippedFilePath}&version={version}&dest={saveDestination}

    VcsLocalServer -) DownloadAgent: Download stats
    DownloadAgent -) TaskManager: Update download stats

    VcsLocalServer ->>- DownloadAgent: Download done


    

    